WEBVTT

00:00:00.150 --> 00:00:01.640
Your career is a puzzle with

00:00:01.640 --> 00:00:04.078
pieces in ten different boxes.

00:00:04.078 --> 00:00:04.878
DSA here.

00:00:04.591 --> 00:00:06.516
Projects there.

00:00:06.516 --> 00:00:08.641
A resume connected to nothing.

00:00:09.977 --> 00:00:11.799
Placiq puts the pieces in one

00:00:11.799 --> 00:00:14.136
place, and remembers how they fit.

00:00:15.175 --> 00:00:15.975
Learn it.

00:00:15.613 --> 00:00:16.413
Build it.

00:00:16.088 --> 00:00:16.888
Prove it.

00:00:16.600 --> 00:00:17.775
Present it.

00:00:18.053 --> 00:00:20.939
Placiq. YOUR WORK, CONNECTED.

00:00:20.939 --> 00:00:21.739
placiq.in
